ux.png` after creating the output directory.\n- Inspect the image. Reject loading screens, empty grids, and blank canvases.\n- Report SwiftShader as CPU software rendering. Do not claim GPU hardware acceleration.\n- Inspect `$HOME/.local/share/omgithub-playwright/linux.json` for launch settings.\n- Use `playwright-cli --help` for commands and named sessions. Pass configuration only to `open`.\n\n## Mobile browser games\n\n- Support Android and iOS phones and tablets with responsive layouts and usable touch controls.\n- Keep gameplay and controls visible within safe areas and avoid browser gesture conflicts.\n- Add tilt controls only when appropriate; offer touch alternatives and request iOS motion permission from a user gesture when needed.\n- Follow explicit device and control requirements in the user request.\n# PlayGround\n\n<!-- omgithub:readme:start -->\n## 🚀 Build, play, and remix with OMGithub\n\n**Created using [OMGithub.com](https://go.ondev.store/).**\n\n[![OMGithub](https://img.shields.io/badge/OMGithub-Open%20project-orange?style=for-the-badge)](https://go.ondev.store/Pantapan1/PlayGround)\n[![GitHub](https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-Source-181717?logo=github&style=for-the-badge)](https://github.com/Pantapan1/PlayGround)\n\n- 🎮 [Open the project](https://go.ondev.store/Pantapan1/PlayGround).\n- ✨ [Remix this project](https://go.ondev.store/Pantapan1/PlayGround?remix=1).\n- 💻 [Explore the source](https://github.com/Pantapan1/PlayGround).\n- 🛠️ [Check build runs](https://github.com/Pantapan1/PlayGround/actions).\n- 🐛 [Report an issue](https://github.com/Pantapan1/PlayGround/issues).\n- 👤 [Explore the creator's projects](https://go.ondev.store/Pantapan1).\n- 🌍 [Create with OMGithub](https://go.ondev.store/).\n<!-- omgithub:readme:end -->\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\ncd \"$(dirname \"$0\")\"\n/usr/bin/time -p node \"${RUNTIME_DIR:?}/scripts/default-start.mjs\"\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\ncd 