filters for grain overlay, scanlines, vignette. Animated particles via canvas globally maybe `StarfieldCanvas` behind UI. Could use CSS.\n\nUI details:\n- Fonts: \"Unbounded\" for display (Cyrillic support? Yes maybe). \"Manrope\" body. \"Cormorant\" for some accent? Use \"Unbounded\" weights 300-700 and \"Manrope\". Need download subsets. Use `curl` with UA to get WOFF2. Let's do after scaffold.\n- Palette: deep space #070b14, cyan #76e6f2, amber #f0b35f, violet #7869ff. Glass panels.\n- Grain overlay.\n- Title screen: full screen cinematic observation background. Top nav: brand `AETHER` + \"STORY ENGINE v1.0\", center tabs? On title, left side big title \"ЭХО / 07\" with tagline, bottom menu card with Continue (\"Продолжить\"), \"Новая игра\", \"Главы\", \"Галерея\", \"Настройки\"; right side vertical story stats and \"Открыть студию\" pill. Use large numerals and lines. Title in Cyrillic: \"ЭХО-7\" with \"ЭХО\" huge and \"7\" outlined. Animated flicker. Top-right sound, fullscreen.\n- Add small \"Демо-проект • 3 главы • 5 концовок\" info.\n- First-time onboarding? Maybe not; title screen obvious.\n\nTop nav in editor: brand, project, mode switch \"Играть\" / \"Студия\", undo/redo? We can implement simple undo maybe. Need not.\n\nEditor layout:\n- Top chrome 58px.\n- Sidebar 290px with project overview and scene list. Group chapters. Search. Scene item shows index, title, line count, active.\n- Center flexible: header \"Сцена / Название\", preview panel 16:9, script list. But screen 1440x900; preview 60% height and list scroll.\nMaybe better:\n  - center split: top \"Stage\" 16:9 in dark frame; bottom \"Beat timeline\" horizontal? Hmm.\n- Right 360px inspector: scene metadata / selected beat.\n- Use two-pane: left scenes, center editor with preview + beats, right inspector. At 1440, 280 + 720 + 340 = 1340.\n- Toolbar above preview: \"Превью\", \"Играть с этой сцены\", \"Добавить реплику\". \n- Beat editor cards: list of beats with type icon, speaker, text (click selects, inline edit). Could allow direct editing with textarea in inspector only. Click beat to select. Add button opens menu (Реплика, Мысль, Выбор, Переход/Финал).\n- Inspector tabs depending selection: \"Сцена\" if no beat, or \"Реплика\" with speaker select, expression, textarea, effects, next. For choices, list choices with text, target scene select, condition.\n- Reordering by drag handle using drag events. Implement.\n- \"Live preview\" shows selected beat on stage, with background from scene, portrait from speaker, text update. Very visual. On title screen editor, preview is useful.\n- Bottom status bar: validation \"✓ 0 ошибок\", nodes count, words, autosave.\n- Character tab maybe in right sidebar / main. Use workspace view toggled by left rail icons. We can implement three modes `script`, `characters`, `variables`, `assets`, `build`. Each main content.\n- Simpler: left icon rail 64px permanently; when mode `script`, show scene sidebar; when others, main content with specific manager. Header changes.\n- Character manager grid cards with portrait, fields. Add character.\n- Variables table.\n- Assets grid showing background thumbnails, music packs, sprite list. \"Импорт\" hidden file input can add background as data URL? We'll implement for backgrounds and maybe cover.\n- Build page: big card with platform \"Android APK\", version, package name, estimated size, checks; build button with progress modal/log; after 2.5s shows download button to `/echo7.apk`. This is simulated build but actual artifact downloadable. We should label \"Эталонная сборка демо\" maybe. To be honest but not break UX. Could have \"Собрать APK\" then progress steps drops actual file. We can compute a Blob of project JSON? Hmm. If the APK is prebuilt demo, custom edits not included. We can make the prebuilt APK load story from a URL? no.\n  \nMaybe implement APK build as **client-generated archive** that's actually an APK? An APK is zip with compiled dex/resources; can't generate without